Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.83,0:00:07.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see twelve soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.50,0:00:10.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, wait, there's another seven disguised as civilians.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.00,0:00:12.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's a strong formation they're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.63,0:00:14.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Whoever's commanding them\Nknows what they're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.46,0:00:17.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wonder if that means you-know-who is here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.29,0:00:18.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.13,0:00:21.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If it were you, how would you break through their line?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.96,0:00:23.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have to do a pop quiz?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.04,0:00:27.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,W-well, I'd start by using poison to knock out\Nwhoever looked like they were in charge-
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.46,0:00:31.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The moment you did, you would be killed\Nlike a balloon floating through the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.50,0:00:33.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure I follow, but I lost?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.79,0:00:41.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,B-Bonfire! What the hell are you doing here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.79,0:00:44.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If we wanted the Foreign Intelligence Office's help,\Nwe would have asked for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.58,0:00:46.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't get all up in my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.67,0:00:47.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's suffocating.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.88,0:00:49.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You son of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.79,0:00:51.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.00,0:00:59.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm Flower Garden, Foreign Intelligence Office.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.13,0:01:04.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Welter Barth, Military Intelligence Department captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.08,0:01:05.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.54,0:01:09.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want all the intel the military has on the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.58,0:01:13.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is the Imperial spy we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.29,0:01:16.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My guess is they're working with a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.13,0:01:21.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My bosses would kill to get some dirt on you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.21,0:01:25.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you two get in our way and the spy\Nmanages to escape because of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.75,0:01:29.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,they'll try to get the Foreign Intelligence Office\Ndisbanded before you can blink.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.58,0:01:31.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You should sit this one out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.25,0:01:34.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I find you insufferable, but that doesn't mean\NI want to see your whole org get shut down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.42,0:01:37.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I appreciate the advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.25,0:01:40.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.92,0:01:42.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-it was nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.08,0:01:49.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, about this spy the military is hunting...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.88,0:01:51.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What, did you figure something out?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.92,0:01:55.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There was a photo of a woman in those files\Nwho bore a striking resemblance to Annette.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.42,0:01:59.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There might be some sort of connection there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.75,0:02:05.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll go ahead and report in to Klaus.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.17,0:02:10.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,After all, we've got a responsibility to\Nhand Matilda over to the military.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.79,0:02:14.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is something you need to remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.38,0:02:16.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When a spy gets captured,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.75,0:02:19.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,the only fate that awaits them is\Na darkness deeper than death.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.13,0:02:24.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hold on! Do you even realize what it is you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.79,0:02:26.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I could ask you the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.33,0:02:29.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's a spy who snuck into our borders.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.00,0:02:30.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's our enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.92,0:02:34.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Be that as it may, she's Annette's mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.63,0:02:37.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Pull yourself together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.13,0:02:39.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For now, all I'm doing is getting Klaus's input.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.92,0:02:44.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And if Teach ordered you to, would you turn Matilda in?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.54,0:02:45.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Probably, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.83,0:02:47.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We wouldn't even have to lift a finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.71,0:02:49.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All we'd have to do is tell the army where she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.08,0:02:53.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You want Annette to just go along with this,\Neven though it might get her mother killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.88,0:02:55.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah. And?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.38,0:02:57.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Teach... Teach will know what to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.29,0:03:01.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He'll think up a fantastic solution.\NI'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.46,0:03:05.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It will be an idea so good,\Nyou two won't have to fight anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.79,0:03:08.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, I like where Erna's head is at.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.13,0:03:10.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's right.\NThis is Klaus we're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.75,0:03:14.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He'll probably guide us to a perfect outcome\Nthat none of us ever considered.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.75,0:03:16.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's no way to be sure of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.08,0:03:19.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here's a little warning for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.21,0:03:22.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you choose to help Matilda out,\Nyou'll be betraying your country.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.67,0:03:25.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In other words, you'll be betraying Lamplight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.75,0:03:29.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But I guess you aren't even the person\NI should be checking in with.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.21,0:03:32.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You get it, right, Annette?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.83,0:03:35.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.46,0:03:38.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.96,0:03:40.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.83,0:03:44.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You think she's going to be able to just nod along and\Nagree when you put her on the spot like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.42,0:03:47.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Fine, then for her sake, you can have one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.58,0:03:52.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But at sunset tomorrow, I'm making that call.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.17,0:03:53.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's your time limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.58,0:03:57.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thea, Annette, and you too, Erna...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.42,0:04:00.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I trust you'll make the right decision as spies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.33,0:04:01.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Traitor or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.75,0:04:04.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,it would hurt having to put a teammate down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.67,0:04:10.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Annette...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.71,0:04:12.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Monika is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.17,0:04:13.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is your issue to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.25,0:04:17.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We might have no choice but to contact Teach,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.13,0:04:21.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but if we do, that might mean\Nyou never get to see Matilda again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.21,0:04:23.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What do you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.50,0:04:24.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.96,0:04:29.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,want to see Matilda one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.33,0:04:33.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.54,0:04:36.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then let's go do that tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.21,0:04:39.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry about all that shouting earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.17,0:04:40.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, Big Sis Thea...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.25,0:04:54.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Thea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.46,0:04:57.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yo, my tummy's rumbling.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.50,0:05:03.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We should go to a bakery next.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.25,0:05:05.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, a seagull!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.17,0:05:10.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, today is the day you all head back to school?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.79,0:05:12.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.17,0:05:14.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please look after my daughter for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.29,0:05:18.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll come by and visit once my work winds down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.67,0:05:20.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm going to ask you this straight, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.96,0:05:23.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Actually, there's no need for me to be polite here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.04,0:05:27.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My friend found your passport,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.17,0:05:30.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and the name inside wasn't Matilda.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.79,0:05:33.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.25,0:05:35.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're a foreign spy, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.79,0:05:39.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry, I'm not going to turn you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.42,0:05:44.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I just want to know what you're really after.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.42,0:05:48.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're absolutely right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.58,0:05:51.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm a spy from the Galgad Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.67,0:05:54.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I knew I couldn't use a fake name around my daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.00,0:05:56.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so I gave you my real name, Matilda.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.63,0:06:02.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I used to be an Imperial engineer,\Nbut when my husband passed away,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.04,0:06:05.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I volunteered to become a spy so\NI could support my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.46,0:06:09.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Most of my spy work involved transporting funds.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.83,0:06:15.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Having a young daughter with me let me draw\Nless suspicion than I would have on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.08,0:06:20.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But then, while I was on a job,\Nwe were in a horrible train crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.71,0:06:26.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I thought my daughter was dead,\Nand after that, I went through life in a daze.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.63,0:06:29.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then, my work tools got stolen,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.17,0:06:32.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and before I knew it, the army had me surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.04,0:06:35.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But please, Thea, you have to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.13,0:06:37.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Understand what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.92,0:06:40.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I know I lied to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.13,0:06:44.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but when I said I wanted to take back that girl,\Nmy daughter, that part was true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.96,0:06:46.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.38,0:06:51.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Annette's lost her memories,\Nand four whole years have gone by.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.08,0:06:56.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We can't even be certain that Annette and\Nthis daughter of yours are even the same person.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.63,0:06:59.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, I'm certain.\NShe hasn't changed a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.54,0:07:02.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Her personality's a little bit different,\Nand she's lost her memories,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.83,0:07:04.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but she's still my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.96,0:07:08.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I give you my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.96,0:07:12.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When I get home, I'm going to retire from being a spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.83,0:07:17.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want to live a quiet life with my daughter,\Nand I never want us to get separated again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.33,0:07:21.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you even going to be able to get home?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.71,0:07:23.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.58,0:07:26.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've sent so many SOS messages to my homeland,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.63,0:07:28.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but all I've been getting is radio silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.88,0:07:31.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think they've probably written me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.63,0:07:34.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.25,0:07:44.50,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Seeing them like this, they really do look like a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.83,0:07:49.08,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,The way things stand, Matilda is going\Nto be tortured and killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.71,0:07:51.79,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,But if I try to help her...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.42,0:07:56.46,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Monika will just brand me as a traitor and kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.75,0:07:58.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Enjoy that discord."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.33,0:08:00.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Differences between allies are\Nthe key to a strong team."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.38,0:08:03.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's a quote I cribbed off the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.33,0:08:05.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ms. Hearth said that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.13,0:08:07.75,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,There's no truth there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.92,0:08:10.33,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,When people's values are too different,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.33,0:08:12.08,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,all it does is make their team fall apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.54,0:08:16.17,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,What should I do, Ms. Hearth?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.88,0:08:21.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, she's the daughter of a\Nnewspaper company's president, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.79,0:08:23.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I feel for you, girlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.46,0:08:26.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you wanna be mad at someone, blame your old man\Nfor that garbage he publishes in his rag.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.08,0:08:58.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're the one, right?\NThe girl who got kidnapped?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.29,0:09:03.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My friends are rooting out the rest of the people\Ninvolved in the plot right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.00,0:09:06.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There was probably a puppet master\Npulling the strings.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.63,0:09:09.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm going to look after you until we find them, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.50,0:09:12.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can you not talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.33,0:09:16.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah, you're traumatized from the kidnapping.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.88,0:09:20.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then, can you think of a sentence in your head?\NAnything will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.04,0:09:28.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"What in the world is she talking about?"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.21,0:09:31.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's written all over your face.\NDid I get it right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.42,0:09:36.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Luckily, I have some experience with this kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.63,0:09:39.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's this boy I took in a few years back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.38,0:09:43.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,At first, the only way I could communicate with him\Nwas by watching his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.63,0:09:46.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The bad news is,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.08,0:09:49.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I ended up spoiling him so much he sucks\Nat holding conversations to this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.75,0:09:54.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We end up having to learn to read\Nexpressions as part of our job,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.00,0:09:56.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but you've got a special skill too, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.33,0:10:09.92,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,If I look someone in the eye,\NI can sort of see what's in their heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.92,0:10:12.33,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Like, I can sense what they desire.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.54,0:10:15.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Whoa! That's impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.54,0:10:20.04,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,But I try not to use it much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.04,0:10:21.79,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,People would think it was creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.00,0:10:24.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why don't you try peering into my heart, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.71,0:10:27.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I mean, aren't you curious?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.38,0:10:29.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You want to know who it is you're dealing with.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.96,0:10:35.75,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Wow! Your heart is so pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.04,0:10:37.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm happy to hear you think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.08,0:10:40.75,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.75,0:10:42.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm a spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.67,0:10:45.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And I'll do whatever it takes to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.96,0:10:50.83,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,As a spy, what's your goal?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.83,0:10:54.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,To move war along to its next stage, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.75,0:10:56.96,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Isn't the war over?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.71,0:11:00.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nope, war never ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.46,0:11:04.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But the thing about people is,\Nwe can change the shape that conflict takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.46,0:11:05.75,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.96,0:11:08.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The Great War ended,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.00,0:11:10.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and now, wars are fought between spies.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.54,0:11:14.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Um, you know what?\NIt's a little hard to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.67,0:11:17.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Basically, I didn't want to be a spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.58,0:11:19.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wanted to be a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.79,0:11:21.04,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,A hero?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.33,0:11:24.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Spies can only save their own people.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.79,0:11:27.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But heroes, heroes can save so much more.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.29,0:11:30.71,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.58,0:11:36.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want to be like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.46,0:11:38.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh hey, you got your voice back!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.50,0:11:41.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Were you mimicking me a little bit there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.46,0:11:46.21,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I thought that if I copied your tone,\NI might be able to talk again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.63,0:11:49.13,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Am I little closer to being like you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.04,0:11:54.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You have it in you to become so much more than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.54,0:11:58.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We won't have long together,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.46,0:12:01.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I guess I should probably teach you a trick or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.42,0:12:04.75,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Thinking back now, I realize that she wasn't just kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.75,0:12:06.71,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,She might have been a little bit extreme, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.96,0:12:08.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Heya, Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.54,0:12:12.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's a reward from me to you, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.92,0:12:16.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Th-thanks...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.42,0:12:18.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Where's Matilda?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.00,0:12:19.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.17,0:12:24.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It looked like you were having a nice conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.33,0:12:26.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's all thanks to you, Sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.71,0:12:30.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then, could you give me your answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.42,0:12:33.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What do you want to do?\NDo you want to save Matilda?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.04,0:12:35.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Or-
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.00,0:12:42.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.21,0:12:45.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's not the direction Matilda's hotel is in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.25,0:12:49.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're worried about her, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.33,0:12:50.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think that's just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.83,0:12:54.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You should do whatever it is your heart tells you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.17,0:12:59.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sis, why are you doing all this for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.17,0:13:04.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Because when I look at you,\Nthat's what my heart tells me to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.92,0:13:07.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can be selfish if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.79,0:13:10.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No matter what, I'll accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.00,0:13:13.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.54,0:13:15.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want to help my mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.75,0:13:20.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then I'll figure out the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.42,0:13:43.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How far are you planning on taking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.46,0:13:47.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We were supposed to be back at\NHeat Haze Palace hours ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.50,0:13:50.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you going to betray Lamplight?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.63,0:13:52.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If so, I'd appreciate it if you told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.38,0:13:56.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll need some time to dispose of your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.13,0:14:02.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What do you say to a little change of scenery?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.92,0:14:05.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's talk this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.42,0:14:08.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The thing is, I don't think either of us are wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.96,0:14:13.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We both have things we refuse to back down on,\Nand we're acting in accordance with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.08,0:14:17.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want to save the people that need saving,\Neven if it means bending the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.92,0:14:22.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You want to do what's right for the team,\Nand you're not willing to make any exceptions.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.33,0:14:24.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What do you say we start from\Na position of mutual respect?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.71,0:14:26.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you done yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.17,0:14:29.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Look, have you made up your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.04,0:14:32.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna turn Matilda in,\Nor are you gonna betray the team?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.96,0:14:34.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm taking the third option.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.63,0:14:35.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.63,0:14:37.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm going to make you submit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.17,0:14:38.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All I have to do is get you to keep quiet,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.88,0:14:41.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and I'll be able to get away with\Nnot turning Matilda in
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.33,0:14:44.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,without my duplicity ever being discovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.46,0:14:45.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I challenge you to a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.88,0:14:49.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You get fifty out of a hundred.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.08,0:14:51.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Woulda been five more\Nif you'd gone for a surprise attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.00,0:14:55.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you think you're close enough to my level\Nto get away with fighting fair, you're dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.13,0:14:57.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then let's get unfair, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.71,0:15:01.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.29,0:15:04.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm no expert, but I'm pretty sure duels\Naren't supposed to involve
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.29,0:15:06.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,calling in a pair of dudes to beat\Nyour opponent senseless.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.67,0:15:10.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can hardly afford to fight fair\Nwhen I'm this outmatched, can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.67,0:15:11.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Screw you, bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.88,0:15:15.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, whoever takes her down gets a special reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.42,0:15:17.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Once we're done here,\NI'll take your deepest, darkest desires
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.67,0:15:20.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and fulfill them to your heart's content.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.25,0:15:23.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Buzz off, perverts!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.21,0:15:29.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.42,0:15:30.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.38,0:15:32.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.58,0:15:35.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Tell me, is that really all you've got up your sleeve?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.21,0:15:39.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If so, this is hardly going to be a challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.21,0:15:42.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't hold back on my account.\NGo ahead and use your gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.17,0:15:43.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, someone's sure full of themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.71,0:15:57.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Right, you turned Erna into one of your little minions.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.04,0:15:58.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I prefer the term "collaborator."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.71,0:16:00.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And I've got Annette's help, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.79,0:16:04.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This fight is really three-against-one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.50,0:16:05.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.79,0:16:08.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have no desire to actually harm you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.33,0:16:12.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't understand why you're so opposed to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.42,0:16:15.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You look down on us, you constantly pick fights,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.04,0:16:17.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,you throw harsh truths no one asked for in our faces...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.54,0:16:20.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why do you even bother staying in Lamplight at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.08,0:16:23.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And why should I explain myself\Nto someone weaker than me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.13,0:16:25.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Stay back, or I'll-
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.08,0:16:27.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's no use; I can see everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.04,0:16:29.88,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,No way! How?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.79,0:16:31.79,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,A mirror?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.79,0:16:33.75,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I get it, that's how she saw where the traps were!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.75,0:16:37.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're done here.\NYou couldn't have failed harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.29,0:16:45.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You really thought that'd work?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.54,0:16:47.83,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,There's no way for me to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.83,0:16:52.33,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,After all, I'm up against the\Nstrongest girl in Lamplight, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.63,0:16:56.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's exactly why I wanted so badly\Nfor you to see things my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.04,0:16:58.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Trying to tug on my heartstrings?\NI feel sorry for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.63,0:17:01.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You ready to call it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.17,0:17:02.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.38,0:17:05.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Am I going to have to kill you\Nto get it through that skull of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.04,0:17:08.79,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I need to put some distance between us,\Nand make sure she falls for the traps this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.83,0:17:13.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're retreating? From here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.96,0:17:15.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.29,0:17:19.13,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,What choice do I have, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.13,0:17:20.54,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I'm not like Monika.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.54,0:17:23.00,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I don't have any weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.42,0:17:25.38,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,And my special ability can't-
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.29,0:17:30.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you hone that ability of yours,\Nyou'll be the strongest spy around.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.00,0:17:33.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want you to become a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.88,0:17:35.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Enjoy that discord.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.50,0:17:38.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The best approach is to butt heads\Nwith your teammates directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.75,0:17:46.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just give up already, you damn slut!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.25,0:17:49.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A hero never gives up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.25,0:17:52.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're going to regret having made me your enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.50,0:17:53.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.04,0:17:59.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm code name Dreamspeaker,\Nand it's time to lure them to their ruin.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.88,0:18:08.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're dead, you're dead, you're dead,\Nyou're dead, you're dead, you're dead, you're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.79,0:18:09.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Tell me, are you in love?\N{\rSubtitle-3}You're dead, dammit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.88,0:18:11.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Tell me, are you in love?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.71,0:18:13.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait, did you-
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.88,0:18:16.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You went to such great lengths to conceal it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.42,0:18:19.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You took those precious feelings,\Nand you hid them from everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.54,0:18:21.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And why? It's simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.79,0:18:23.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Because the other person is someone close by.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.04,0:18:27.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're in love with someone in Lamplight, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.08,0:18:28.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're dead...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.29,0:18:29.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can't kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.50,0:18:31.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Think of how sad it would make them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.50,0:18:35.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The reason you want to eliminate Matilda\Nis to protect Lamplight,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.13,0:18:37.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,the place your crush calls home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.88,0:18:43.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If we help her, the team might end up\Nbeing accused of aiding an Imperial spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.71,0:18:46.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're really single-minded in your love.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.50,0:18:49.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Quit trampling all over my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.96,0:18:51.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sure, I'll stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.96,0:18:54.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, help me out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.50,0:18:56.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I respect your feelings!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.58,0:18:59.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, I'm asking you to consider mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.88,0:19:01.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.67,0:19:03.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Condition one...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.00,0:19:06.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't tell anyone about my secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.17,0:19:07.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.21,0:19:10.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I won't bring it up again,\Nand I won't try to figure out who it is, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.54,0:19:14.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Condition two: if I ever think the army is\Ngoing to figure out what you're doing,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.21,0:19:16.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm handing Matilda over on the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.38,0:19:17.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This one's just as non-negotiable.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.79,0:19:19.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Agreed, please do, in fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.63,0:19:20.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Condition three!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.83,0:19:22.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's a lot of conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.08,0:19:24.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,About, y'know...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.58,0:19:28.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't tell anyone that we kissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.33,0:19:30.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll take it under advisement.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.92,0:19:33.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You wanna throw down again?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.58,0:19:34.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.79,0:19:36.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If we fought again, I'd end up dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.88,0:19:39.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you can agree to all three of those conditions...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.83,0:19:43.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,then fine, I surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.04,0:19:45.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.63,0:19:48.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why are you talking like the boss, all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.75,0:19:51.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Felt like the thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.38,0:19:55.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I was the wrong person\Nto have to play this role.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.92,0:20:02.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lamplight's members all have\Na serious ruthlessness deficiency.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.00,0:20:03.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're all too soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.08,0:20:09.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Even here, I should be putting my\Npersonal feelings aside and stopping you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.21,0:20:13.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is gonna get us into hot water.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.54,0:20:17.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Eventually, we're going to go up against an enemy\Nthat takes advantage of that kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.63,0:20:27.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did it go okay, Big Sis?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.38,0:20:28.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Swimmingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.75,0:20:32.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Monika agreed to help us save Matilda.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.58,0:20:35.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.50,0:20:37.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't jump at me.\NI'm in a bad mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.54,0:20:38.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's no need to be shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.88,0:20:40.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna give you a big ol' kiss, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.67,0:20:43.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've had enough trauma for one day, thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.46,0:20:45.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're under no obligation to take part in this, Erna.\N{\rSubtitle-4}Hey, quit running away! C'mon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.33,0:20:46.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're under no obligation to take part in this, Erna.\N{\rSubtitle-4}Stay back! Stay back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.54,0:20:47.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're under no obligation to take part in this, Erna.\N{\rSubtitle-4}The hell's your problem?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.75,0:20:49.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Could you tell me how you feel about all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.54,0:20:53.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have a condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.54,0:20:54.54,Subtitle-5,,0,0,0,,Come back here, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.54,0:20:56.21,Subtitle-5,,0,0,0,,Quit being so clingy, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.58,0:20:59.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Annette, you have to promise\Nyou'll never bully me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.25,0:21:05.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,From now on, I want you to treat me\Nlike a normal f-friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.17,0:21:08.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you agree to that, then I'll help out too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.29,0:21:12.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've thought we were friends this whole time, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.58,0:21:13.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeep!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.71,0:21:27.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mom, you have to quit being a spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.17,0:21:29.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Annette meant what she said.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.96,0:21:31.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We need you to promise that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.54,0:21:36.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You may have figured it out already,\Nbut we're spies working for the Republic.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.17,0:21:39.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We've been competitors this whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.33,0:21:40.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.54,0:21:42.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, we can't help enemy spies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.71,0:21:44.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's why you have to retire.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.50,0:21:49.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you can promise that,\Nwe'll help you escape across the border.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.08,0:21:50.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.71,0:21:53.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're going to break straight through\Nthe army's siege.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.54,0:21:54.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's all there is to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.79,0:21:57.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So? Did you end up reporting in to Klaus?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.75,0:21:58.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.33,0:22:01.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's obvious he would object to what we're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.63,0:22:04.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's probably worried about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.46,0:22:07.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's morning now, and we're still not back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.42,0:22:09.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It is what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.04,0:22:12.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's time for all of us to disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.00,0:22:13.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's got a scary ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.04,0:22:15.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.58,0:22:16.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't hate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.83,0:22:19.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The four of us will go missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.29,0:22:21.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We'll be like lost children, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.33,0:22:31.92,Song,,0,0,0,,Ah, standing on one leg and feeling the pain
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.75,0:22:37.75,Song,,0,0,0,,I've shared it with you, are you getting this vertigo?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.21,0:22:43.58,Song,,0,0,0,,I've got love, but that's not what's washing over me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.75,0:22:49.13,Song,,0,0,0,,I spring up, I spring up, I'm a nuisance and I'm in the way
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.54,0:22:52.17,Song,,0,0,0,,Am I "really okay"?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.17,0:22:54.79,Song,,0,0,0,,What good will asking that do?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.96,0:23:00.21,Song,,0,0,0,,Just praise me and be on your way
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.33,0:23:03.96,Song,,0,0,0,,Blame it on a mirror that's unspeakable, unhealable
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.96,0:23:07.33,Song,,0,0,0,,A sullied life that's unseeable, unfading
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.50,0:23:12.00,Song,,0,0,0,,Tear right on through and see through lies with frigid eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.21,0:23:14.88,Song,,0,0,0,,An innocent item that's unbeatable, unbuyable
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.88,0:23:18.21,Song,,0,0,0,,It's an undiscarded corpse, after all
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.42,0:23:23.71,Song,,0,0,0,,Fight back naked with your unconcealed resolve in hand
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.83,0:23:26.08,Song,,0,0,0,,(whoo, whoo, ooh)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.08,0:23:29.08,Song,,0,0,0,,A wishy-washy destiny all covered in graffiti
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.29,0:23:31.58,Song,,0,0,0,,(whoo, whoo, ooh)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.58,0:23:35.21,Song,,0,0,0,,Recklessly deceiving even God
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.58,0:02:05.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(294.4,619.2)}{\an7}Two Days Before the Others Began Their Search
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.67,0:02:10.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(819.2,129.6)}{\an7}MISSION: Forgetter III
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.42,0:13:28.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(793.6,547.2)}{\an7}MISSION: Forgetter III
